LINES = [ "I got really into farming by playing a bunch of Shitville Farmhouse on my expensive gaming PC.", "At some point I just wasn't getting anything out of it so I decided I'd started farming for real, in real life.", "So here we are, not in a video game, and I have my own agricultural business.", "It's a lot easier than the game because I can just make other people do the hard work for me.", "It's slurpnip season in Darkworld." ]

